{"id":"wb-3-112","name":"大云院","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"大云院 (平顺)","text":"大云院，又称大云寺，位于山西省长治市平顺县北耽车乡实会村龙耳山内，毗邻王曲村天台庵和潞城黄牛蹄乡辛安村的原起寺。大云院创建于五代后晋，是中国现存仅有的几座五代时期建筑之一。寺院现存建筑有山门、大殿、后殿、两庑以及七宝塔。\n大云院大殿与七宝塔为五代遗存，其它建筑均为清代遗构。寺内存宋碑2通，明清碑7通，五代壁画28.83平方米。大殿的结构、设计与建筑保存有五代风格。除建筑结构外，大殿内还保存有重要的五代佛教壁画。1988年大云院被国务院列为第三批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%A4%A7%E4%BA%91%E9%99%A2_(%E5%B9%B3%E9%A1%BA)","revisionId":95268094,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=95268094","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/f6a126abcb0712276cdee793.jpg","title":"20260405_Dayun_Temple_01.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20260405_Dayun_Temple_01.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/54/20260405_Dayun_Temple_01.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​平顺 大云院","width":320,"height":213}}